# Souris — Supabase client configuration (public values, shipped inside the app)
#
# Both values come from the Supabase dashboard: Project › Connect › App Frameworks
# (Expo / React Native), or Project Settings › API Keys.
#
#   EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL              the project URL: https://<project-ref>.supabase.co
#   EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY  the PUBLISHABLE key (sb_publishable_…)
#
# Never put the secret key (sb_secret_…), the service_role key, or the
# database password here: security comes from Auth + Row Level Security.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (gitignored) and fill both values, then restart
# `npx expo start` so the values are inlined into the JavaScript bundle.

EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
